  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: The <a href=\"/tag/income+tax+department\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Income Tax Department</a> has moved to the appellate tribunal, ITAT, challenging the tax relief granted to <a href=\"/tag/dr+lal+pathlabs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Lal PathLabs</a> for an expense of Rs 32.66 cr, the diagnostic services provider said on Thursday.<a>Dr Lal PathLabs</a>, in a regulatory filing, said that it received an intimation on Wednesday regarding an appeal filed by the I-T Department before the Income Tax Appellate Tribunal (ITAT), New Delhi.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The department has challenged an order passed by the Commissioner of Income Tax (Appeals) granting relief to the company for Assessment Year 2022-23 under Section 250 of the Income Tax Act, 1961, the filing said.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The order provided relief to the company against the disallowance of ESOP expenses amounting to Rs 32,66,18,927.Dr Lal PathLabs said it \"does not reasonably expect the outcome of the appeal to have any material impact\" on the company.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654375/PTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PTI</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 9, 2026 at 07:35 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 9, 2026 at 07:35 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-